 ( { or even } 1... g4 $1 { intending } 2. Rxg4 Rd3 { - Baburin. Anyway, one shouldn't be too harsh on a blitz game. } ) 
2. Kg4 $1 { Suddenly Black is unable to dislodge the white king without exposing his own king to checks. } Rd6 3. Ra4 Kf6 4. Rb4 Re6 5. Ra4 Re5 6. Ra6+ Ke7 7. Rb6 $1 { Continuing with a waiting game. } ( { Of course } 7. Ra7 $2 Kd6 { would let Black improve his king, thus increasing his practical chances. } ) 
Kd7 8. Ra6 Ke7 9. Rb6 Kf7 10. Ra6 Re6 11. Ra5 Rg6 12. Ra7+ Kf6 13. Ra6+ Kg7 14. Ra7+ Kh6 15. Ra5 { Black can't make progress and the game soon ended in a draw. } 
